#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186289220 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0272b8d6-8400-5a6d-b51d-fc6ca84bd166" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e5669635-9956-5e62-b8d3-ebc7c9ac5b32" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sqrt{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186289222}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e5669635-9956-5e62-b8d3-ebc7c9ac5b32" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sqrt{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186289222} :answer-field/id #uuid "82129578-1092-5512-bc14-e44ab2f9fbe3" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186289221}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "e3d7e857-f860-5925-9b71-d1c2560557c0" :question/math-academy-id "q-320558" :question/problem "Given that the area spanned between the vectors $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}-\\sqrt{7} \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ -10\\end{aligned}]$ equals zero, what is the value of $a?$\n\n$a=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-\\sqrt{7} & a \\\\ 5 & -10\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}-\\sqrt{7} & a \\\\ 5 & -10\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-\\sqrt{7})(-10)-a\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =10\\sqrt{7}-5a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, setting the expression for the determinant equal to $0$ and solving for $a,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}10\\sqrt{7}-5a & =0 \\\\ 5a & =10\\sqrt{7} \\\\ a & =2\\sqrt{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
